            "review_title": "Review at O Xuan Hue Restaurant",
            "review_text": "danny t\nkuala lumpur25 contributions\n0\nDelicious Hue Food\nMar 2015 • Solo\nThe Imperial and Royal city of Hue have some Vietnam best cuisines that some said fit for the king. Normally the food serving is small, refined and nicely presented a trace of its cultural Royal cuisine. O Xuan in HCM city deliver a very tasty Hue food. They also have some other regional food but their Hue specialty dishes are the must try ones. Some of them are Banh Uot, Banh Beo, Bun Bo Hue, Cha Cay, and so many others.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 29, 2015",
